gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=15;fontColor=#345746;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="screen-493"><mxGeometry x="48.0" y="1088.0" width="140.0" height="92.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="screen-561" value="Find your next favorite, close to home." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#4F5A53;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="screen-493"><mxGeometry x="190.0" y="1088.0" width="400.0" height="92.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="screen-562" value="Classroom prototype · Sample listings only" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;align=right;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=12.5;fontColor=#4F5A53;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="screen-493"><mxGeometry x="872.0" y="1088.0" width="360.0" height="92.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="screen-563" value="&lt;b&gt;From lo-fi:&lt;/b&gt; confirmation banner at the top right after booking, then a list where each visit shows item, store, date and time. Each row has View details and Cancel visit. Cancel opens a confirm dialog (States page) and then shows an Undo toast.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Not built yet:&lt;/b&gt; booking.html only shows a success template. This board is the spec for the new page." style="shape=note;size=16;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF2CC;strokeColor=#D6B656;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=14;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#3D3420;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="7200.0" y="1210.0" width="600.0" height="210.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="screen-564" value="6 · How it works + sustainability" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Georgia;fontSize=26;fontColor=#1D1D1B;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="8640.0" y="-64.0" width="1280.0" height="34.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="screen-565" value="technology.html" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=13;fontColor=#6B6B66;fontStyle=0;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="8640.0" y="-30.0" width="1280.0" height="20.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="screen-566" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F6F3EC;strokeColor=#C9C2B5;strokeWidth=1;container=1;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;shadow=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="8640.0" y="0.0" width="1280.0" height="2000.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="screen-567" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F6F3EC;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="screen-566"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="0.0" width="1280.0" height="78.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="screen-568" value="" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#D5CFC3;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;" vertex="1" parent="screen-566"><mxGeometry x="0.0" y="77.0" width="1280.0" height="1.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="screen-569" value="&lt;div style=&quot;letter-spacing:3.4px;&quot;&gt;RETHREAD&lt;span style=&quot;color:#A66B45&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=visible;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=20;fontColor=#345746;fontStyle=1;spacing=0;spacingLeft=0;spacingRight=0;spacingTop=0;spacingBottom=0;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="screen-566"><mxGeometry x="48.